WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.920
So tell me,

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.520
have you done this a lot?

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.340
Met people on the computer service?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.700
Don't you find, it's always the same?

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.080
You mean the anticipation, followed by the letdown?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.420
But I tell myself "Brace up. This time it will be different."

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.840
Which is why I must now confess to you a deception of my part.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.760
My name is in fact not Brian, it's Roy.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.380
To the future.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.380
How much is this worth?

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.380
Nearly three million pounds!

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.880
There's a lot!

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.120
You bloody bet, I'm gonna take it off.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.420
Is that your grandson?

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.760
It's too soon to be getting so close to him.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:58.800
I've grown very fond of you.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.140
Do you know who you are?

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:04.440
You're the only person on this planet who makes me feel that I'm not alone.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.320
I know things about you.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.100
Who you really are.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.100
You don't want to do this Roy.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:16.740
The game.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.800
The adrenaline rush.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:22.820
What if it is?

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.560
Seems like you've had quite a past.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:34.760
Enough to last several lifetimes.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.620
In just a blink your life changed forever.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.160
You know, it's very peculiar doing things you'd never imagined.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.460
Secrets between you,

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:51.840
God,

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:53.920
the devil,

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:58.520
and the dead.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.860
You don't know him!

